+recipe, not that paper's organism, task, performance claims, or learned
+weights.
+
+Final full host-module rerun: **19 passed, 0 failed**, 506.32 seconds. This is
+12 original frozen-source fixtures plus 7 new baseline-diagnostic/candidate
+tests. The broader sleep/lifecycle regressions still use the baseline source;
+they do not demonstrate a full new-candidate life. Shared mediation rerun:
+**46 passed, 0 failed**, 64.68 seconds. It includes the four existing grouped
+confidence-host gates. Complete unchanged-source diagnosis and ownership JSON
+from this rerun exactly equal the initial pre-candidate records. All source,
+target-asset, compiler-input, phenotype and genotype identities of the
+candidate exactly equal those from the initial V1 probe after correcting only
+metadata.
+
+`REFERENCE_FINAL.json.gz` contains all five final candidate gate receipts with
+corrected address labels and charged-work wording.
+`REFERENCE_FINAL_SUMMARY.json` contains the compact native comparisons, warm
+transitions, matched-food timing, source-S versus aggregate readouts,
+identities and held-out context results.
+
+Final `cargo clippy --offline -p alife_training --features cpu-backend --lib
+--tests -- -D warnings`, `cargo fmt --all -- --check`, and `git diff --check`
+passed. `VALIDATION.json` preserves commands, exit statuses and original-log
+hashes; concise test listings and complete short failure logs accompany it.
+Unit tolerances were selected after the initial mechanism probe to distinguish
+small native residuals from a wrong sign or lost need response. This is not a
+preregistered or independent seed-generalization result.
+
+## Documentation cleanup and historical checksums
+
+The later prose-spacing cleanup changes no Rust source, coefficient, JSON
+summary, captured diagnostic, log or historical receipt. `SHA256SUMS` remains
